        StringKey.BeekeeperLogWaspRaidFmt to "The wasp helps itself to %@ honey, and %@ bees fly off.",
        StringKey.BeekeeperLogBribeFmt to "You set out %@ honey. The wasp takes it and buzzes off.",
        StringKey.BeekeeperLogWaspLeft to "The wasp loses interest and drifts off.",
        StringKey.BeekeeperLogCandleLit to "You light a candle. The wasps keep their distance.",
        StringKey.BeekeeperLogCandleOut to "The candle gutters out.",
        StringKey.HelpBeekeeperWorkbenchTitle to "🕯️ The Workbench & Wasps",
        StringKey.HelpBeekeeperWorkbench to "At your 3rd comb, The Workbench opens. Make a beeswax candle from 10 wax. Once you've made 5 candles, the Hippies arrive: they give 1 sage for every 10 beeswax candles. Your first sage unlocks the sage repellent candle (10 wax + 1 sage).\n\nOnce the Shop is open, The Workbench also sells Honey Supers (+1,000 honey room) and Wax Trays (+8 wax room) for Beebits. You can buy them again and again; each costs a little more than the last.\n\nWasps start to come by too, but only while you're playing Beekeeper. When one arrives you have a minute to throw a shoe (it misses 4 times in 10), bribe it with a quarter of your honey, or light a repellent candle (no wasps for 15 minutes of play). If the wasp gets through, it helps itself to some honey. Bribe enough wasps and the wasp nest sends an emissary: the raids stop for good, repellent candles are no longer needed, and the wasps trade paper for honey (50 honey a sheet).\n\nOnce the poplar has sprouted, two more candles join The Workbench, made with propolis. The bee-boost candle makes the combs make more honey for a while, but only while you play. The sage-propolis candle adds a little more honey for hours and keeps burning while the app is closed.\n\nOnce The Workbench is open, the Beekeeper's Shop also sells upgrades: bigger combs (more room for honey and wax), a better Wax-Catcher, stronger candles, and later the Notebook and the Propolis Seal (more room for honey and wax). Bought upgrades leave the Shop.",
