        StringKey.BeekeeperCalmNowFmt to "The bees are calm: %@ left · honey ×%@",
        StringKey.BeekeeperPuff to "Puff the Smoker",
        StringKey.BeekeeperLogSmokerPuffed to "You puff the smoker. The hive settles and hums.",
        StringKey.BeekeeperLogCalmEnded to "The smoke drifts away.",
        StringKey.HelpBeekeeperSmokerTitle to "💨 Catching More & the Smoker",
        StringKey.HelpBeekeeperSmoker to "After the Bee-Safe Vacuum, the Shop sells more tools (Bee Lure, Flower Cart, Hive Whistle) and Practice upgrades that make every click catch more. Every catch also brings in a small slice of your free bees (0.1%), so a big swarm of free bees grows faster (up to 10 times what your tool catches).\n\nThe Smoker, also in the Shop, fills a little with every click. When it's full, press Puff the Smoker: for 2 minutes the bees are calm and the combs make double honey.",
