        StringKey.BeekeeperLogWelcomeBackPantry to "The pantry ran empty while you were gone.",
        StringKey.HelpBeekeeperQueenTitle to "👑 The Queen & the Trade Agreement",
        StringKey.HelpBeekeeperQueen to "When your bees move into the wooden hive, the queen settles in and starts to lay: she raises 20 new free bees a minute, even while the app is closed. Every 100 bees she raises eat 1 bee bread, so keep the pantry stocked at The Workbench before you leave. When the bee bread runs out she simply rests until there is more; no bees are lost.\n\nAfter 25 trades, the bear offers a trade agreement: from then on he pays a better price, 8 honey for 1 Beebit instead of 10. He never takes honey on his own; when the combs are full, honey simply stops.",
